<p>Turn into a wraith, allowing you to walk through walls and removing the need to breath for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns.</p><p>Also increases your defense and armour by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 10, 13, 17, 20</acronym> and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 8, 11, 13, 16,</acronym> respectively.</p><p>If you are still in a wall when the effect ends you will randomly teleport.</p><p></p>